description.narrative:
Bidlisiw is specialised in the economic empowerment of youth in vulnerable situations and works with 15 internal, 12 external TVET providers and 45 private companies;
CYC works on (indigenous) youth leadership and reinforces 14 youth-led org and 350 youth leaders (175m/f);
PETA uses inclusive theatre arts within and outside of the formal school setting. They work with 10 public secondary schools, 35 teachers (17m/18f), 3 youth theatre organisations and 15 young artist leaders (7m/8f).
